      50.64,
      375.24,
      288.8,
      474.52
    ],
    "text": "I, do hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of Land Acquisition Act, that the state intends to acquire the following lands which is require for a public purpose. Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
